    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yakobo kūja Misili",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Isilaeli ūbūūka ū lūgendo lwakwe, nī shikolo shakwe ūshijana pye ī shose. Aho washika Beeli-sheba ūmfunīja shitambo ū Mulungu wa ng'wa ise Isaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Mulungu wiyoolecha ū kūlī Isilaeli mu makanza ga būjikū ūyomba nang'hwe; ūng'witana gīkī, “Yakobo! Yakobo!” Nang'hwe widīka, “Kalame.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūhaya, “Ū nene nalī Mulungu, Mulungu wa ng'wa so; ūtizoogoha ū kūja ī Misili, nguno nakūkwīta ūbize ihanga itaale ū kwenūko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakūja hamò nang'ho ī Misili; hanuma nakūkūshosha hangī ū kūūnū, gūzunyage ū gwenūyo. Hama ū Yosefu h'ūyo akūgakundīkīja a miso gako na nkono gwakwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yakobo ūbūūka īngile ī Beeli-sheba; a bitūnja ba ng'wa Isilaeli būmūcha ū saabo, ū Yakobo ū mu magogoteeni ayo Falao walī wagatūma kwiza kūmūkīja; būbabūūcha na a baana babo na a bake babo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būjiswaga nī mitugo jabo, nī shikolo shabo īsho baalī bapandīka ū mu Kanaani būshibūūcha; ū Yakobo ūsaamīla Misili hamò na a babyalwa bakwe a bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbajana Misili a bitūnja bakwe na a bashīke bakwe na a bizūkūlū bakwe, pye a babyalwa bakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A benaba baalī bitūnja abo Leya akamyalīla Yakobo makanza gene bataalī Padani-alamu; kūleka kūng'wisaaba ū nshīke wakwe ū Dina. Ūbukūmi wabo a bitūnja bose na a bashīke bakwe baalī makūmi adatū na badatū (33).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bitūnja benaba ū Yakobo akabyalīlwa na Zilipa, ūyo Labani akang'winha nshīke wakwe Leya. Abose baalī ikūmi na batandatū (16).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A benaba hū baalī bitūnja ba ng'wa Yakobo abo bakabyalwa na Biliha, ūyo Labani akang'winha nshīke wakwe Laheli. A bose baalī mpungatī (7). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū a bose abo bakaja na Yakobo Misili, abo baalī ba būbyīle wakwe dūhū, kūleka kūbisaaba a bīnga bakwe, baalī banhū makūmi atandatū na batandatū ū wingī wabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ūbasanja na a bitūnja abo akabyalīlwa Yosefu mu Misili, a banhū ba mu kaya ya ng'wa Yakobo abo bakaja Misili baalī makūmi mpungatī ū wingī wabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yakobo kūbiza ng'wikaji wa Misili",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yakobo ūntūma ū Yuda atonge ū kūlī Yosefu akoolekejiwe chiza ī nzīla ya kūja ī Gosheni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yosefu ūsangwa amalīīlile alindanile n'igogoteeni lyakwe, na lūūlū ūja ī Gosheni kūnsūng'wanha ū ise ū Isilaeli. Kūshika dūhū aho walī ū ise, ūng'wibuga ūnkumbatīla, ūlīla ikanza itaale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Isilaeli ūng'wīla ū Yosefu gīkī, “Ī haha lūūlū yashila, nūūlū nakacha nigejaga. Nguno nakūbona na miso gane gīkī ng'hana ūtaalī ūlīho ūlī mpanga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yosefu ūbawīla a baana ba ng'wawe nī kaya ya ng'wa ise gīkī, “Leka naje ū kūlī Falao, nakayombe nang'hwe nang'wīle, ‘Ī kaya ya ng'wa baba, na a baana ba ng'wise, abo baalikalaga mu sī ya Kanaani bizaga kūlī nene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū benabo basugi ba mitugo; ū nīmo gwabo kūdīīma. Bajenhanījaga nī mitugo jabo, balī na ng'holo na ng'ombe; pye nī shikolo shabo ī shingī.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Falao ūlū ūng'witana ūmubūja gīkī, ‘Ū nīmo gwing'we ni nīmo kī?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nshokejagi gīkī, ‘A bise basese bako ū nīmo gwise kūfuma ha būdo gūlī kūdīīma mitugo; hū nīmo gwa bataale bise kūfuma kale.’ Ūlū ng'wīta gīko mukūzunīlījiwa ū kwikala ū mu sī ya Gosheni, nguno ū kū bana Misili būlī ndīīmi adalahilwe gīkī nsoso.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
